# .gitignore — PCIe Kernel Driver + UART Protocol project

# ── Kernel module build artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────
*.ko
*.o
*.mod
*.mod.c
*.mod.o
*.order
*.symvers
.tmp_versions/
*.d
modules.order
Module.symvers

# ── Compiled userspace binaries ─────────────────────────────────────────────
edu-driver/edu_test
uart-protocol/uart_test
uart-protocol/reliable/uart_reliable_test

# ── QEMU disk images and seed ISOs (large binary files, never commit these) ─
*.img
*.iso
*.qcow2

# ── Cloud-init generated output ──────────────────────────────────────────────
seed.iso

# ── macOS system junk ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
__MACOSX/

# ── Editor files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ── Personal study notes — NOT for the public repo ───────────────────────────
PERSONAL_NOTES.md
HOWTO.md
